# Git commits — no AI attribution

- Never pass `--trailer "Co-authored-by: ..."` to `git commit`.
- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Claude`, or `Made-with: Cursor` to commit messages.
- Use plain `git commit -m "message"` only.
